{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  Coastline GEO — FAQPage JSON-LD  (cc-faq-schema.liquid)
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  WHERE TO INCLUDE:
    On the FAQ page template/section (template that renders
    /pages/faqs). Render once:
      {% render 'cc-faq-schema' %}

  WHY:
    /pages/faqs currently emits only Organization JSON-LD.
    FAQPage markup makes every Q&A directly extractable by
    ChatGPT / Perplexity / Gemini / AI Overviews — the single
    highest-ROI citability win for this site.

  RULE:
    Schema must match the Q&A visible on the page. These 35
    pairs are transcribed verbatim from the live /pages/faqs
    (2026-05-24). If you add/remove/edit a FAQ on the page,
    mirror it here. Formulation facts (magnesium CITRATE,
    lithium 400mcg, vegan glucosamine) are intentionally exact.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org/",
